<title>MEXICO: NEW MEXICO TO MEXICO CATTLE EXPORT UPDATE -USDA.</title>
<headline>NEW MEXICO TO MEXICO CATTLE EXPORT UPDATE -USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly update of New Mexico cattle exports to Mexico, to Aug 9 - USDA.</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year).</p>
<p>	Beef cattle		Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		     860	    18,965     3,355</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    14	     2,387	   0</p>
<p>    Calves			    0	     1,787	   0</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males, females    49	     5,990	 822</p>
<p>((--Chris Aspin, Mexico City newsroom (525) 7289530. E-mail at chris.aspin@reuters.com))</p>
